<title>UK: Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs rise one to 68.</title>
<headline>Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs rise one to 68.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of active oil and gas rigs in operation offshore northwest Europe rose to 68 in the week ending January 15, compared with 67 rigs active in the previous week , consultants Arthur Andersen said.</p>
<p>U.K. rigs rose by two to 35, Norway fell two to 17 and the Netherlands was up one at 12 rigs. Denmark was unchanged at four.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4984</p>
